OL,3,AE-motorbike killer's jail sentence
OL,4,Aincreased
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who knocked down and killed an
OL,7,F86-year-old grandmother while on an
OL,8,Fillegal e-motorbike has had his jail
OL,9,Fterm increased by almost two years
OL,10,Fafter the initial sentence was ruled
OL,11,Funduly lenient.
OL,13,FBilly Stokoe, then 18, had taken
OL,14,Fcannabis and was using a mobile phone
OL,15,Fwhen he hit Gloria Stephenson on a
OL,16,Fzebra crossing in Sunderland last year
OL,17,Fand then rode off, leaving her dying.
OL,19,FIn May this year, Stokoe was given a
OL,20,Fsentence of six years and nine months
OL,21,Fafter admitting causing death by
OL,22,Fdangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
