OL,3,AE-motorbike killer's jail sentence
OL,4,Aincreased
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat was referred to the Court of
OL,7,FAppeal on behalf of Solicitor General
OL,8,FAndy Slaughter and the Court of Appeal
OL,9,Fhas now raised it to eight years and
OL,10,Fsix months.
